  "version": "esper-parity/v1",
  "id": "epl-variables-event-typed",
  "description": "EPLVariablesEventTyped event-typed and bean-typed variable semantics: Object/bean/event-type variables with null reads, single and bulk runtime set/get, and filtered on-set whole-event assignment (ord 0), a five-variable module with property navigation, on-set property mutation and filtered whole-event replacement (ord 1), preconfigured global variable reads plus a deployment-scoped create (ord 2), set-prop assignments that emit varbean.theString/varbean.intPrimitive columns, no-op on null receivers, copy-on-write, sequential self-evaluation and int-to-long widening (ord 3), type-mismatch probes asserted by error category (ord 4), and create-schema plus event-typed variable assignment with orderId reads (ord 5). listener records mirror assertPropsNew rows; variable records mirror getVariableValue; snapshot records mirror assertIterator; error records carry the category token since declared-type rendering differs (Java source regression-lib/src/main/java/com/espertech/esper/regressionlib/suite/epl/variable/EPLVariablesEventTyped.java).",
